    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096330/extras/0e0c80443ca573769ecef368c98821a1.avif?t=1752316918\" width=620 height=130 /></span>Uh-oh! 200 mischievous house cats are causing mayhem in homes everywhere!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a purr-suit to find them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096330/extras/6ef0176272849579970fb05a74588ba7.avif?t=1752316918\" width=310 height=65 /></span>    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae 1 Level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    \ud83d\udc08 200 Hidden Cats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     \ud83d\udca1 Hint System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    \ud83c\udfb5 Relaxing Music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    \ud83d\ude3a Real Meow Sounds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    \ud83c\udfa8 3D Environment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    \ud83d\udd0d Zoom</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    \ud83c\udfae Steam Achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096330/extras/b746a33cb60fb49d9ad1699111e9fb0a.avif?t=1752316918\" width=310 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left Mouse to find a cat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right Mouse and drag to move around!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD to move around!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scroll Wheel to zoom!</p>",
